200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Benjamins (7\u201311 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:10<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">10,00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Run (at\u00e9 6 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">10,00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a nova data e local da 3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026 realiza-se na nova data oficial de 14 de novembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta junto \u00e0 Casa do Povo de Faj\u00e3 Grande, no concelho das Lajes das Flores, Ilha das Flores (A\u00e7ores).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada escal\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa come\u00e7a com a Kids Run de 500 m (at\u00e9 aos 6 anos) \u00e0s 15:45\/16:00, seguida \u00e0s 16:10 pelas provas de Benjamins (1.500 m, 7-11 anos) e Infantis\/Iniciados (2.500 m, 12-15 anos). \u00c0s 16:30 partem a Corrida de 7.500 m (Juvenis\/Juniores e Seniores Masculinos), a Corrida de 5.000 m (escal\u00f5es femininos e Veteranos I\/II Masculinos) e a Caminhada de 2.500 m.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o custo de 10,00 \u20ac na 1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 26 de outubro de 2026, com tamanho de t-shirt garantido) e de 12,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa Fase diretamente com a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o (at\u00e9 6 de novembro de 2026). Inclui dorsal, t-shirt, pr\u00e9mio finisher, seguro desportivo, pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00e3o e conv\u00edvio final com castanhas e beberete.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e a que horas funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no dia da prova, junto \u00e0 Casa do Povo de Faj\u00e3 Grande, a partir das 14:00, devendo o kit de atleta ser levantado obrigatoriamente entre as 14:00 e as 15:45.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a 3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Atl\u00e9tico Clube Faj\u00e3 Grande (contactos: 960 084 837 \/ 918 182 186 \/ atleticoclubefajagrande@gmail.com), contando com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio das Lajes das Flores.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Casa do Povo de Faj\u00e3 Grande, Lajes das Flores, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lajes das Flores\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026 realiza-se na nova data de 14 de novembro em Faj\u00e3 Grande, Lajes das Flores (A\u00e7ores), com 7,5 km, 5 km e caminhada.\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-corrida-e-caminhada-de-sao-martinho.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 7,5 km (Juvenis\/Juniores e Seniores M)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/3-corrida-e-caminhada-de-sao-martinho\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 5 km (Femininos Geral e Veteranos M)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/3-corrida-e-caminhada-de-sao-martinho\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 2,5 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"